    "从暂停恢复播放时展开歌词；播放中切歌不展开，手动收起后保持收起" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shows the lyrics when playback resumes from pause. Switching songs during playback doesn’t expand them, and lyrics you collapsed stay collapsed"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Muestra la letra al reanudar tras una pausa. Cambiar de canción durante la reproducción no la expande, y la letra que contraigas sigue contraída"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一時停止から再生を再開したときに歌詞を展開します。再生中の曲の切り替えでは展開せず、手動で折りたたんだ場合はそのままです"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "일시 정지 상태에서 재생을 재개하면 가사를 펼칩니다. 재생 중 노래를 바꿀 때는 펼치지 않으며, 직접 접은 경우 접힌 상태를 유지합니다"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从暂停恢复播放时展开歌词；播放中切歌不展开，手动收起后保持收起"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "從暫停恢復播放時展開歌詞；播放中切歌不展開，手動收起後保持收起"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "暂停 10 秒后收起为功能栏图标，恢复播放时自动展开" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Collapses to the Control Strip button after 10 seconds paused, and expands again when playback resumes"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se contrae al botón de la Control Strip tras 10 segundos en pausa y se expande de nuevo al reanudar"
